{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong> is a hypnotic 2D arcade rhythm challenge where you control a bouncing ball in a dazzlingly colorful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm is your guide:</strong> Jump up to the beat of a powerful soundtrack. The music isn't just background; it's the pulse of the game, guiding you when to act.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful chaos:</strong> Break through a kaleidoscope of ever-changing obstacles. You'll face an explosion of colors and new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect control:</strong> All you need is a cool head and a single click. Tap to jump upwards. Skillfully maneuver between traps, moving blocks, and narrow passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless drive:</strong> Fight for a place on the leaderboards. How many meters can you conquer before gravity takes over?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual ecstasy:</strong> Simple yet juicy graphics create a unique feeling of total immersion in this shimmering world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Leaderboards:</strong> Unlock unique achievements and prove to everyone who the true rhythm king is on the global leaderboards!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4147220/2478e33f13a5b4878295bfc11d092e23de732af3.jpg"},{"name":"Persistent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4147220/2d9cad52d3a8f8f986ce55e63ad56a400f28eb39.jpg"},{"name":"Unlucky Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4147220/ec8fc58b35f624f6985c96a8e130d49bfc4c41c9.jpg"},{"name":"Wow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4147220